{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n視后江美儀在TVB節目《璀璨之城》中演技大爆發！她飾演精神病復發的丁麗明，將角色的瘋癲與情緒失控演繹得淋漓盡致，其「極速變臉」神技更令觀眾嘖嘖稱奇，網民洗版式讚好，更力推她為今年「最佳女配角」的不二之選，直指她的瘋狂完全不像演出來！\n</p>\n<h2>江美儀瘋癲入血 上秒狂笑下秒變狠</h2>\n<p>江美儀在劇中完美演活了丁麗明瘋瘋癲癲、情緒大起大落的極致狀態。最令網民佩服的是她「極速變臉」的神級演技，上一秒還在放聲狂笑，下一秒眼神便能瞬間轉為極度兇狠或瘋狂，情緒切換自如，讓觀眾看得不寒而慄。不少網民認為她的演繹極具說服力，完全不像在演戲，而是角色本身，瘋狂程度已深入骨髓，成功塑造出一個令人心寒的經典奸角形象。</p>\n<h2>幕後花絮曝光 2分鐘戲份竟通宵拍攝</h2>\n<p>除了與張智霖的對手戲火花四濺，江美儀在社交網站亦提及了與前輩姜大衞的對峙戲。她透露，雖然該場口在螢幕上只有約2分鐘，但整個團隊卻由晚上一直拍到隔天早上六點多才收工，足證製作團隊對細節的執著與演員的敬業精神。為了呈現最完美的演出，即使是短暫的戲份也絕不馬虎，這份認真的態度也讓觀眾更加投入劇情之中。</p>\n<h2>網民洗版讚好戲：今年最佳女配不二之選</h2>\n<p>江美儀的精湛演出連日來獲得網民洗版式讚好，紛紛留言力撐她問鼎獎項：「江美儀的戲真的好好，不愧係視后。」、「美儀姐嘅笑容令我諗起經典奸角鷲哥同埋唐立言，都係笑得你心裏發寒！」、「呢種癲雞角色好難演，但佢carry得好好！」、「今年最佳女配角絕對係佢，冇對手！」、「睇佢做戲真係一種享受，每個表情都係戲！」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/04_3575165326aeabd148a5e4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/04_3575165326aeabd148a5e4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/07_2384630706aeabd1e38cef.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/07_2384630706aeabd1e38cef.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/08_16924937466aeabd2188928.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/08_16924937466aeabd2188928.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_18252554916aeabd305052e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_18252554916aeabd305052e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_8895483876aeabd36eccb1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_8895483876aeabd36eccb1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_11943579056aeabd3a952c8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_11943579056aeabd3a952c8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_582771486aeabd4408481.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_582771486aeabd4408481.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_14736485266aeabd46eaa32.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_14736485266aeabd46eaa32.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_7766964566aeabd49cdd62.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_7766964566aeabd49cdd62.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T08:25:33.117309+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":943,"images":9,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T08:00:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T08:18:42.747648+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T08:18:42.747648+00:00","content_hash":"ad5ff87821b784e9a399459f19698f00e2722472d44eae2c876e7721951ee7ae","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}